# 同一对象的两个指针比较：按偏移收窄（oobsum/specs/SPEC-0081）。原来指针比较不产生信息，while (p < e) 只能记 pointer_stepping。
#
# RUN: %clang_analyze_cc1 -triple armebv7-linux-gnueabi -fno-signed-char -analyzer-checker=rb.enhance.ipa.OobSummary \
# RUN:   -analyzer-config rb.enhance.ipa.OobSummary:InlineDepth=0 -analyzer-config rb.enhance.ipa.OobSummary:ReportSafe=true \
# RUN:   -analyzer-config rb.enhance.ipa.OobSummary:Dump=state -analyzer-config 'rb.enhance.ipa.OobSummary:DumpFilter=^P1$' \
# RUN:   %S/Inputs/ptrcmp/p.c 2>&1 | FileCheck %s

CHECK-DAG: [oobsum:state] fn P1 b3: p=*p0+[0, p1]:loop n=p1 e=*p0+p1 (head)
CHECK-DAG: [oobsum:state] fn P1 b2: p=*p0+[0, p1 - 1]:loop n=p1 e=*p0+p1
CHECK-DAG: p.c:5:1: warning: [OOB-POSSIBLE] Possible out-of-bound write through a 1-level call chain: up to byte 17 of 'a' (16 bytes) may be accessed; the bound comes from a loop condition
CHECK-DAG: p.c:6:1: warning: [OOB-SAFE:within] Proven within bounds: up to byte 16 of 'a' (16 bytes)
CHECK-DAG: p.c:8:1: warning: [OOB-SUSPECT:pointer_stepping] Cannot prove this access is within bounds: the pointer is advanced in a loop
